{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>In a time of favor I answered you.</b> This too is a witness to the hint, and many said that the kaf of עניתיך refers back to Cyrus, but the pericope is not contiguous, and Rabbi Moses said that the bet of בעת רצון is like the bet of במרחב יה (Psalms 118:5), and it is not far-fetched:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:40.683493900Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}